      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 2. The Community Board Assistance Unit shall be responsible for coordinating the activities of City agencies with respect to the implementation and operation of the provisions of the Charter of the City of New York concerning community boards, district service cabinets and district managers, including, but not limited to, responsibility for:",
