        1399,
        742
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(a) coordinating (i) the establishment of coterminous service districts by designated agencies and (ii) the assignment by each such agency of a managerial official with operating or line authority over agency programs, personnel and facilities to the district service cabinet, in accordance with Sections 2704 and 2705 of the Charter;",
      "logprob_stats": {
