      "text": "(b) designing and implementing, in conjunction with the Mayor's Office of Operations, a new format for the Mayor's Management Report and Supplemental Management Report which includes, insofar as practicable, schedules of agency service goals, performance measures and actual performance relative to goals, for each local service district in accordance with Section 12 of the Charter;",
